OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 81, stabbed nephew 11 times,
OL,4,Amurder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 81-year-old man stabbed his nephew
OL,7,F11 times and then started a fire to
OL,8,Fcover up the murder, a court has heard.
OL,10,FFirefighters found Andrew Avery, 65,
OL,11,Flying in a smoke-filled house in
OL,12,FGosport, Hampshire, in November 2024.
OL,14,FDefendant Alan Wotton, who was living
OL,15,Fin the property which Avery was trying
OL,16,Fto sell, told the officers his nephew
OL,17,Fhad attacked him with the knife after a
OL,18,Fdispute over an inheritance, Portsmouth
OL,19,FCrown Court heard.
OL,21,FWotton, who is now aged 83, denies the
OL,22,Fmurder charge.
